=== layout: one-panel

# [*Steps in Interference*]{color=#000000}

@body

- 1. [Count the observed double crossovers.]{color=#D40000}
- 2. [Multiply the two adjacent interval probabilities.]{color=#B74300}
  - This predicts the double-crossover fraction if the intervals are independent.
- 3. [Multiply by the total offspring to get the expected count.]{color=#007A00}
- 4. [Divide observed by expected: coefficient of coincidence.]{color=#003FFF}
- 5. [Subtract coincidence from one: interference.]{color=#A719DB}

